<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">EN_EULT en_English_ltr Fri Nov 13 2020 12:23:15 GMT+0530 (India Standard Time) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Ephesame</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paul ne Ephesame dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesame</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eph.</para>
  <para style="mt">Ephesians</para>
  <para style="mt">Paul ne Ephesame dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul Rome ga (AD 60) mmi kena hebaangtei keladau laisiu aide raugai. Laisiu aide Ephesus ngqwa dage rünne ma dede Ephesus taiga Khristianme ngqwadung dage raukegai nzwa. Cidau Ephesus au kemlang namdi kedige, cine cide au Khristianme ngqwadung ziemne sumga kebam ge.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ephesame laisiu ga Paul samdi cai ket ketei nah Tinggwang mariem, cide cai “Ma pelane tinggim gade kideu gade peu ge Khrista kang gage teugwang kecütlu kerade.” Aide ket kelu gade, Paul raugai, Khristianme pelane Jisu gade ngngwa kelak ge, nah penui hangge gede kereku kerabe. Pa kenlummedung de nau-henah, puipei-hename, nah kilame-mpaume ngngwa kelungh zaidung gade dainzwa “kereku eh kelungh teilung” teilu maisiabi keledeusamdung peugai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiu aika paul ngqwabe hade raugai—heni gega ngqwaki ma dede Khristianme lungh kegwang leuh pelane ne ngqwa tei kelude. Anui aide de “pelane ngqwa” lie qula. Pa Khrista penai ngqwabe ngngwa kelungzai de hepum, ki ge, nah henau ge teilung gage kedagai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Kelumkegai (1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khrista nah ngqwabe (1:3-3:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kenlumme teilung zai (4:1-6:9)</para>
  <para style="io1">Khristianme reutak (6:10-20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kekambe (6:21-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s">Kelumkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Paul, Tinggwang lungning gade Khrista Jisu ne langkegaibe, Ephesus namdi ga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiudung kehegwa kekiee ge</char><char style="fqa">Ephesus ga, de kecu de si ma</char>.</note> kebam nah Khrista Jisu gade samsang eh kebam kemcimedung dage kekai. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Anui pei Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista dade kegwang ngaugia nah lungciep de peu nnuida bam kelube teilo.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista gade Rabe samlam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Peu Tinggwang nah anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista Peibe de hetwa pung kelube tei lulo, Khrista gade ngngwa ket tei kelu gade nreule de kegwang mirabe kilam samlam leune pa anuide samlamgai beuda. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kideu tei kemak dwade pa anuide pe gu tei zielie Khrista gade kedet luda, iciu eh anui pe dwade mci nah kemau tei mene bamlu kerane. Keku gade <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />pe lungning keyi de nzwa pa anuide Jisu Khrista gade pe name tei zielie mrai riem pwala. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Pa pe na pe Kube gade pe ngaugia kendu mta mapeu anuide kepeu ziemne pecu twa go. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Khrista jai ne anuide ri luda, cide anui maudung gibeu dida. Pe ngaugia dai dige di no, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />pa anuide maci nah macet pelane mbang süt eh kepeu de. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Tinggwang pe lungning keyi ria gade pe macetkecok de peu anuide cigai da, Khrista gade pa riemteu kelade, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />cide peting siakdau Khrista gade ma pelane, Tinggim ga gudung nah kideu ga gudung pe dage keuncütlu kerane. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ma pelane pa riem nah cet kelu nzwa teilu. Nah pa riem teu kela nzwa eh Khrista gade anuide kedet pwa peu pe ma kegumme teilu, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />iciu eh anui, Khrista gade keregui ngau raitume tei eh pe kendu gage lungh gailu kerane. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Khrista gade, nnui de, nnuide kelikelu samliakeyi kesang samde siulwe nnui pecu nlum keludau, sampetkelu Kemci Rabe le nnuide giak luda, <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Kemci Rabe au anui mabam gum canglu kemaktane anuide gum luzie pe sam kai kebeu deda. Pe kendu de twa lugo.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenggai nah kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Aide ziemne, nnui Rampaube Jisu de kenlum nah pe minadung pelane de keku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga </char><char style="fqa">keku de si la ma</char>, dede laisiudung yitube ga cide sila.</note> ha Ih siu luge, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />Ih nnui ziemne mtakdi mene twa bamla, a kekiedung gade nnuide nsung kecu tei eh, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />iciu eh anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista Tinggwang, kendu Peibe, nnuide maci nah saukelia rabe peu eh peu pecu cilu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:2">Isa. 11:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Ih kekie au nnui mlung ngkei pwa pe kebaa ngaulu kera deda, iciu eh nnuide qugai kelu keregui de daibi kecu nah peu kemcimedung de gum zielie kebeu pe mapwa kendu keyi de daidung ge bi kecu, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />nah anui kenlumme dade pe bata tei kebam kengkieng de dai dige dibi kecu peu nnuide cilu kerane. Kengkieng anuida heta tei kebam de au, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />kengkieng pa Khrista de ketsai gade kwakcuh kelu nah peu tinggim ga pe ba zetlebie bam kelu kengkieng deda. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Khrista hegwang nah kedime, nah kengkieng nah kengkiengketeume pelane, nah hezi mtak kelu leune, cudau teilung rünne ma, dede gwangdai kera teilung leune reu ngkiengtube. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Nah Tinggwang ma pelane pwa Khrista pi kang gage kai dida nah pecu ma pelane reu peube tei kera ziemne ngqwabe de peu dida. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Ngqwabe cide Khrista pum da, pa cangsiak kecube, ma pelane ga kelabe.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Khrista gade teimring kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Nnui samzai tei kemak nah kemau gade piage tsai dida, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />nnui kideu teilung zai nzwa samzai tei kemak namedung da heta tei kebam tingkai kengkiengdung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tingkai ga kengkiengdung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herakesiadung tingkai ga lungh nah kengkieng teu kebamme. </char></note> rabe caisui eh piage tet gwang, <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />anui pelane de piage anui pumteih lungning kesiadung tei eh lunghgwang, anui pumteih lungningbe tei nah anui suibe tei eh. Nah mina pelane nzwa anuide lunghop name tei eh lunghgwang. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Dede Tinggwang pe keku kedi ziemne anuide ngaugia süt eh pa anuide hungla, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />cine anui kemaudung gade tsaidi liede, pa anuide peu Khrista de ngngwa ring dailu—ngaugia gade nnuide kelilu— <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />nah Khrista de ngngwa anuide teu cuhlu, delwe Khrista Jisu gade anuide peu pecu ngngwa tinggim ga bamlu, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />iciu eh gwangdai kera teilung gade pa Khrista Jisu gade anuida pe zaikeyi ngaugia kedi mdet canggai kelak de pwa lialu kerane. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Kedanemene nnuide kenlum gade ngaugia ne kelilu, nah aide nnuikatei nnui ta gade ma; cide Tinggwang mta mapeu, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />batadung gade ma, cine migede ngang daulak. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Kedanemene anui au pe bata, heta keyi tei kera ziemne Khrista Jisu gade damlu, cide Tinggwang ne riem nswa pwala, iciu eh anui cidungde ga tetlu kerane.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista gade ket</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Ciziemne, nnui piage pumteihbe gade Gentileme tei kelade nsung lulo, nnuide “Hegeurumkelume” de kelame ne “Hegeurumkemakme” de qula, cide au pumteih gage mina bale teilu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Kedanemene cipau tingdau nnui Khrista dade mdeila, Israelme maadung ga ncüt ma, nah sampetkelu samkakdungde ga sangme ge teila, kideu ga Tinggwang de si ma nah keregui gede gah. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Dede cu au Khrista Jisu gade nnui piage mdei kelame de Khrista jai gade ngngwa gwang nna luda. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Kedanemene Khrista ne anui kezuyibe, pa ne heleuh kena de ket tei dida, nah penaide rie ntsam pwa eh kengaurau bamkela riede pe pum le teipang dida. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Pa kezai kai kebeudung nah hezai riet keludung de tei nggahdi, iciu eh heleuh kena de keu pecu ngngwa mina keheci ge teilu kerane, ainzwa eh ngngwa keyi teibeu, <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />nah pa cross gade penai kengaurau kelade tei nggahdi, iciu eh penaide peu pum ge tei eh Tinggwang de ngngwa kezuyi dailu kerane. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Nah pa gwang delwe nnui mdei kelame nah nna kelame dage lungciep samliakeyi ranglia, <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />kedanemene anui Jewme nah Jewme kemakme de pe dade Rabe ge gade peibe da lütlu kebui bamdi delu. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Cine, nnui cikemakme nah sangme meda. Meliene, nnui au pe minadung de ngngwa kemacüt dida nah Tinggwang kilungme tei dida. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Nnuide langkegaime nah caihakecime ne pebangdwa kebeu gage tei luda, nah Khrista Jisu pe kimiaktsube<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kimiaktsube: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ki ga ngkiengtube tei eh tangtsu mlangtube.</char></note> da, <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />pe dade ki peciakne, keu reincütlwe Rampaube dage kai kebeu kemci kerecaki ge mmi petlu, <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />pe dade nnuide de nlumkelume pelane de nzang Tinggwang pe Rabe gade lungh kera ki ge ga teincüt luda.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Paul Gentileme dage zierang keteibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Aipau kiede ziemne Ih, Paul, nnui Gentileme ziemne Khrista Jisu baang tei kelabe, <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />nnui ziemne Tinggwang ngaugia ta tei kerane acu kepeude nnui siulu cai, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />pe kengkiem mariem de acu keuliagai eh peu cikelu gade, Ih aipau hade duitu gage raugai dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eph. 2:11-22.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Nah nnui cide pei gaide, nnui Khrista ha macetkecok Ih ci kelude ci luzie, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />cide ceheu kedadung ga minadung de peu ci ma dede Kemci Rabe gade pa ne langkegai kemcime nah caihakecime de peu cigai— <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />cide cai Gentileme samliakeyi be gade kemapwame nah pum ge ga kencütme teilu, nah Khrista Jisu gade Tinggwang sampet kebeu de ga ngngwa kemazime teilu, <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />cide ziemne Ih Tinggwang ngaugia mapeu gade kilame ge teilu, cide pe kengkieng bata gade acu peu. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ih, kenlumme kakgade ceutu nabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kenlumme kakgade ceutu nabe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kenlumme kakgade mautube tei eh mina pecu keu hegielu kera magede gah kecu rehi ge gage kaipwa ladi.</char></note> liede, Gentileme dage Khrista keyi peikap gaikelak de ledeu kera ngaugia aide acu pwapeu, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />nah ma pekiene dam kegaibe Tinggwang mmi kekiee ge kebai pwa kela macetkecok de dapai bi kecu mina pelane de peu cilu kerane, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />iciu eh cu ngqwabe de peu Tinggwang maci macet ketsamtsam pwa tinggim ga kedime nah kengkieng teukela leune de peu cilu kerane. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Tinggwang ndaa de riemteu kelade nzwa anui Rampaube Khrista Jisu dade tei canglu, <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />pecu nlum kelu gade anui ngngidi mene pe da gwanglu kebui kekuu bam dida. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Ciziemne, Ih nnui ziemne keherei kegaidung de ziemne nnui lung siadi helo nnui dage kie gaila, cide au nnui ziuyi ziemne lie.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephesame ziemne kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Aipau kiede ziemne Ih Peibe Tinggwang dwade koktung eh kekie tei bamla, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />pe dade kelak keheibe de tinggim gade nah kideu gade pe zi ngaulu. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Ih peu pe kendu kedi gade nnui lung tei ntiplu kera pe Rabe gade kengkieng nnuide peulo kie bamla, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />nah kenlum gade nnui lungga Khrista de peu bamlu kerane, iciu eh keku gage nnui mahreilwe pe bangdwalu kerane, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />iciu eh pe minadung de ngngwa eh Khrista keku dai langge, dai tiege, dai huge nah dai cokge bi peu nnuide cicangsiaklu kerane, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />nah peu nnuide Khrista keku, maci le cicang gaikelak de peu cilu kerane, iciu eh peu nnuide Tinggwang zaireli siakbe le<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tinggwang zaireli siakbe le: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mdet canggai kelak pe kendu kebam ga Tinggwang ncu qulu nah peu cika silu eh peda kehega bamdi kecu.</char></note> kepui teilu kerane.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Nah pe kengkieng gade anui lungga bata tei kebambe, anui kekie swade mede kemning swade teikiee gwalu kebuibe de, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />peu ngqwa gade nah Khrista Jisu gade nah ceheudung pelane gade kelungta ndu lamui kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Khrista pum gade ket</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Ciziemne Ih, Rampaube baang teikelabe, nnuide Tinggwang qugai keluga petau tei eh tet lulo nnuide rangsünne gaila, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />henah, nciep, nah nnui lungtie muilu, hangge ge dade nnui lungtie eh kereku lu, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />nnuide kang ncütkelu kezuyi Kemci Rabe gade ngngwa ket keteide kaizeulu kerane nnui laikai tei bamlu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Nnuide Tinggwang qugai keluga kereguide ket kecu nzwa, cika pum ge nah Rabe de ket, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Rampaube ket, kenlum ket, duipum ket, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Tinggwang ket nah pelane Peibe, pa au pelane reu, nah pelane da la, nah pelane ga la. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Nah Khrista mta mapeu mdet nzüt gade anui ketket de ngaugia peu ciau pwabam. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ciziemne kesanglaisiu ga ainzwa rangla:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Pa kehu ga kehang dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">pa hebaangme kekiee de teuswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">nah pa mina de mta mapeu peubeu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 68:18</char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Nah, “Pa nghangdi,” de kecu samde pa kideu kehenah ga nghung delie kecu kiede meni? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Nghung kecube de au Tinggim pelane reu nghang kecube deda, iciu eh pa ma pelane ga puilu kerane. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Nah Khrista peu kangge de langkegaime tei kera, nah kangge de peu caihakecime tei kera, nah kangge de peu samliakeyi kepaume tei kera, nah kangge de peu meurün kekwame nah keledeume tei kera peu, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />iciu eh peu kemcimedung de mi gwaketei gade heta tei hemilu kerane nah Khrista pumbe teucuh lu kerane, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />anui pelane kenlum gade nah Tinggwang Nabe de keci ga ket tei eh anui mina ngkieng canglu eh Khrista nzwa cangsiaklu kemaktane, <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />iciude anui hename nzwa mpet nlüt tadi zie, nah keledeu leune kaigui ne gui kelien pwa kela ga nah mide kecwame ciem petau kemak ga la sita dizie. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Meliene, keku gade kesangbe rang eh Khrista, pe peube dage anui ma pelane gade lunghgai lugo, <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />pe dage pumbe pelane keriangkeu ncüt pwabam nah pe nnie ne tamtok pelane riangkeu ncütlu, pezi ket ket kecu pe ta teigai ge pumbe lungh cuh eh keku gade mmicuh lula.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kebaabe name tei eh kelungh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Ciziemne, Ih nnuide Gentileme penui kecetdung kemta tei eh lungh kela nzwa lungh sita lulo aide rang gaila nah Rampaube zi gade kie gaila. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Penui kecet au kemui ga la nah Tinggwang ne kepeu teilung gade mdei la, kedanemene penuida mang kecude kebamne, nah penui lung tak kecu ziemne. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Penui da kenggam ketde gah, penui kenlien tadung tei eh mci kemak ta leune tei neusüt lala. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Dede nnui Khrista ha ci kelude cinzwa ma, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />nnui pe ha siu luda, nah Jisu da kesangbe kebamde nnuide ledeu beuda. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Nnui zaireli teilung kehegwabe ga kelade püt dilu, teilung kehegwade mide cwa kela hengin de ziemne ngkap kezeude, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />delwe rabe gade nnui kecet teiheci dailu, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />nah teilung kehecibe, Tinggwang rehi nzwa samsang nah kemci kesangbe gade dam kelude teu bahlu.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Ciziemne, kemret keugidi eh, nnui keheibe de pe kidabe dade kesangbe ranglu, kedanemene anui au pumge ga peupeime kaplu. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Nnui ratalu dede kemau teiso. Peu nnui rata eh tingnaimiak nlüt diso,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Lei. 4:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />mede herakesiabe de zuiyi keyi gede peu so. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Keregabe de rega sita dilu. Dede pa pe bale bata keyi tei eh heta tei maisia, iciu eh pa teu maikesiame de ma pwa peulu kerane. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Nnui mui gade sam kesiabe kette peu rangpet so, dede sam keyibe, mi teumai kesiabe mide teu cuhlu kerabe rünne ranglu, iciude kekingneime de peu ngaugia ngaulu zie. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Nah Tinggwang Kemci Rabe suisiet teiso, pe dade nnuide rilu kera benai ziemne giaklu delu. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Peu helung kekaa pekiene, nah lunghop, nah rata, nah regi kecu, nah mide kii kecu, lungcet kesia leune si eh gidi lu. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Meliene, hangge ge dade nnui zai yi nah helung ncieplu, ketket maugi beulu, Khrista gade Tinggwang nnui maugi kebeu nzwa.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Pe kumedung kecu nzwa, Tinggwang zai kerelime tei lulo, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />nah Khrista anuide ku eh Tinggwang dage marim kehengui keru nzwa nah ratak tei eh anui ziemne pe pum kai kebeu nzwa, anui keku ga tetla lugo.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Dede kemcime ziemne petau kemak nzwa, nnui kakga kemmha nah mcikemak pelane mede ma kehengin rang kerabe ma, <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />nah kehera nah kemtasam kerang mede teu henui ketei sam, petau kemakdung, meliene, nnuida peu hetwa kepeu bam lulo. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Aide ci mcilu, kemmhame pelane mede mci kemakbe mede ma keheginbe, (cide mamie kerecame), Khrista nah Tinggwang hegwangram ga pe ma gah. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Kemta sam le mide peu nnuide cwa diso, kedanemene aidungde ziemne samzai tei kemakmedung reu Tinggwang rata gwang zielu. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Ciziemne, cipaume dungde ngngwa zangna teiso, <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />kedanemene nnui piage kemui ga la, dede cu au Rampaube gade kebaa ga la dida. Kebaabe name tei eh lungh lulo <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />(kedanemene kebaabe tsi au makeyi leune ga nah kesamsang nah kesangbe ga bam lalu), <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />nah sünne eh Rampaube lungning daibi ci lulo. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Nah petsi bui kemak kemui batadung ga ncüt so, meliene penuide kebaa gage teu mpetlu. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Kedanemene penui ngkim eh tei keladung de au rangde ngngam lu. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Dede ma pelane kebaa ga teumpet kegaidau, cide ngau dila, kedanemene ma pelane de ngau kedibe au baa di delu. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Ciziemne ainzwa rangla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Mraklu, O zip kezeubo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mraklu, O zip kelabo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samria aide kesanglaisiu gade mene kenlumme leikwak gade keu keluge. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">nah ketsai gade cuhlu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">iciude Khrista n dade baa luzie.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Cizieme nnui dainzwa lungh labi sünne lulo, kemieme nzwadi so dede kemriakme nzwalu, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />peting kebamde teuci sütlu kedanemene petingbe sia bamlu. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Aide ziemne, mie so, dede Rampaube lungning daibi kecude cilu. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Nah zau sakmie so, cide mide tei msia dizie. Meliene, Kemci Rabe le kepui teilu, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />hangge ge dage lei nah ketwa lei nah kemci leidung teu eh sam ranglu, nnui lung gade leitei eh nnui suikeyi lei teipwa Rampaube de peulu, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />ma pelane ziemne anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista zi gade Peibe Tinggwang de hetwa peu muilu. <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Nnui Khrista de kerüt gade hangge ge dage henah gai lulo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Henau henah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Minaumedung, Rampaube dage nzwa, nnui nahpeime kangga lunghlu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Kedanemene mi nahpei ge au Khrista ngqwabe peube kecu nzwa pe nau peube da, nah Khrista pe pekatei pe pum de kelikelube da. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Dede ngqwabe Khrista kangga kelungh nzwa, minaumedung de ma pelane gade penui nahpeidung kangga lungh lulo. <verse eid="EPH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Mi nahmedung, Khrista ngqwabe de hung eh pe pum kai kebeu nzwa nnuide nnui naumedung de hung lulo, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />iciu eh pa Tinggwang sam teu eh ngqwabe de dui le hui mcilwe ngqwabe de tei mcilu kerane,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hegwa zai nah miswakega kengkieng gade mene, dede samsang eh kesangbe de mi mlung gage teimzai eh sambe le ngqwabe de huimci kecu.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />iciude Khrista ngqwabe de pekatei pecu ndusüt eh pwa peulu kerane, zamra mede mneudi mene mede cidung ketde bam mene, dede kemau gahzing nah mci bamlu kerane. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Cinzwa eh, mi nahmedung pekatei pe pum de keku nzwa penui naudung de hunglu maisia. Pe naude hung kelabe pekatei pecu hungla. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Migede madaude pekatei pe pumde ngkau lama, dede Khrista ngqwabe dage tei kegai nzwa pa cide pok tei sünne eh pie teune lula, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />kedanemene anui au pe pum ga peupeime delu. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Aide ziemne mipei ge pe pei nah pe puide gidi eh pe naude ngngwa ncüt dizie, nah penai teih ge teidi zie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Ken. 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Macetkecok aide mlang süt, nah Ih Khrista nah ngqwabe ha rang bam. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Cinzwa delwe, nnui hangge ge kecu de pekatei pecu keku nzwa, pe naude kulu maisia, nah pe naude pe nahpei de rütlu maisai.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Hename nah puipeime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Henamedung, Rampaube gade nnui puipei sam mzailu, kedanemene aide petau lu. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“N pui nah n peide rütlu” (aide sampet si eh sam kaikebeu raitube), <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“iciude nang yi luzie nah nang kideu ga ringtie luzie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Tet. 20:12</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Hez. 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Nah mipeimedung, nnui name suisiet rang penui rata teiso. Meliene, penuide peu samzai ketei nah Rampaube ha keci gade lungh cuhlu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilame nah pe mpaume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Kilamedung, ngngi nah mbeu eh nnui kideu mpaumedung samzai teilu, nnui Khrista gwa ketei nzwa eh lungsang gade teilu, <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />mina miakngau gade mina suiyi teiso, dede Khrista kilamedung nzwa, nnui lung gade Tinggwang lungningbe teilu, <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />nnui zai yi eh mina ziemne mene Rampaube gwaketei nzwa tei lulo. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Mina keheibe de, kilame mede kilame kemakme de, pa makeyi teigai cai, Rampaube dade pa ziehi ngau luzie kecu ci lulo.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Nah mi mpaumedung, penui dage cinzwa teigai lu. Keheu kecu mtaklu. Nnui nah penui Mpaube,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mpaube: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang</char></note> tinggim ga kebam nah pa heneuherüt teila kemak nnui ci bam.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tinggwang reunet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Kekambe, Rampaube gade nah pe kengkieng gade ngkiengbam lulo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngkiengbam lulo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paul Galatiame de Rampaube kengkieng rünne gade kengkieng keregui bamlie kecu rang nsung gai.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Tinggwang reunet pelane teulu, iciude nnui herakesiabe heciem teikela gade ngkieng luzie. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Kedanemene anui mi teih nah mi jai de ngngwa keregi ma, dede kedime, kengkieng keteumedung, kideu kemui teu kebamme, tinggim ga kesia rabe maadungde ngngwa renia bamlu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Aide ziemne, Tinggwang reunet pelane teulu, iciude nnui kesiabe tingdau regi sap luzie, nah ma aidungde teikap lude, nnui sap ntip luzie. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Ciziemne, kesangbe le nnui kia kanglu, nah kesamsangbe le nnui hekarakcum teilwe sap ntiplu, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />nah lungciep samliakeyi de le teu nnui picum teilwe mtei pwabam muilu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Mapelane gade kenlum geu punglu, cide le nnui kesiabe lakpitsi heu kebam pelane teimmüt lubui. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Nah kelikelu peurwa nah Kemci Rabe kiengtie de keulu, cide au Tinggwang sam. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Kengha kekie leune ga, keheidau de Rabe gade kekie tei eh kiebam muilu. Nah lia eh kemcime pelane ziemne kie eh kwa bamlu, kekam ga kecang de, <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />nah a ziemne de kielu, iciude Ih a mui ngkei kegaidau acu peu sam ranglu kerane, iciu eh peu kuusüt eh samliakeyi kecokde paulia eh mide peu cilu kerane <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />(Ih samliakeyi de ziemne samgwa baangme ge teila), iciu eh rang maikesiabe Ih kuusüt eh ranglu kerane.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sam kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Iciu eh peu nnuide Ih dainzwa bambi, nah daipai tei bambi kecu cilu kerane, a kube nah masang eh Rampaube ta kelabe, Tychicus nnuide ma pelane ranglia zie, <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ih aipau kiede ziemne pecu nnui dage langgai, iciu eh peu nnuide anui tei keladungde cilu kerane nah nnui lung tei ngkuu silu kerane.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Peu Peibe Tinggwang nah Rampaube Jisu Khrista dade lungciep, nah keku kenlum si eh sinamedung da bam kelube tei lulo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista de lungsang teu hung kelame pelane da peu Tinggwang ngaugia bam kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>